OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of killing teen in
OL,4,Arobbery attempt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fmurdering a 19-year-old after stabbing
OL,8,Fhim eight times in an attempted
OL,9,Frobbery.
OL,11,FKent Police said Musa Salih tried to
OL,12,Flock Harley Purdue in a toilet in the
OL,13,Fbasement of a building in Thorold Road,
OL,14,FChatham, at about 03:00 GMT on 2
OL,15,FDecember 2025, and attacked and killed
OL,16,Fthe victim following an altercation.
OL,18,FSalih, 19, of Greenford in London, was
OL,19,Farrested the same day in Lewisham and
OL,20,Fhis phone showed he had asked an AI app
OL,21,Ffor legal advice, police added.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
