OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of killing teen in
OL,4,Arobbery attempt
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was found guilty of murder at
OL,7,FMaidstone Crown Court on Thursday.
OL,8,FSalih, who Kent Police say is an
OL,9,FEritrean national, will be sentenced on
OL,10,F4 November.
